WEBVTT

00:00.700 --> 00:03.100
So much to learn. Where do you even start?

00:05.900 --> 00:08.100
Ask your AI for a course on anything.

00:09.200 --> 00:12.300
It builds one in LearnWohl — real decks, in order.

00:13.200 --> 00:15.900
Each deck unlocks once you've mastered the last.

00:17.200 --> 00:21.300
Then you just study. Each card comes back right before you'd forget it.

00:27.500 --> 00:29.900
learnwohl.app
